精简定位结果（只定位+原文引用，未改代码）：

**1. `ui/ui_wifi.c` — `scan_done`粘滞→每500ms全量重建**

* 轮询+定时器：
  * `/data/dm/vendor/allwinnertech/apps/luncher_dm/ui/ui_wifi.c:590-599`
```c
static void wifi_poll_cb(lv_timer_t *timer)
{
    (void)timer;
    if (dm_net_wifi_scan_failed() && wifi_status_lbl) {
        lv_label_set_text(wifi_status_lbl, "扫描失败，请点\"重新扫描\"重试");
    } else if (dm_net_wifi_scan_done() && wifi_list_cont) {
        wifi_rebuild_list(); // 无清标志/built守卫，每轮都进
    }
```
  * `/data/dm/vendor/allwinnertech/apps/luncher_dm/ui/ui_wifi.c:837-839`：`wifi_timer = lv_timer_create(wifi_poll_cb, 500, NULL);`
* 全量重建：
  * `/data/dm/vendor/allwinnertech/apps/luncher_dm/ui/ui_wifi.c:513-519`
```c
static void wifi_rebuild_list(void)
{
    if (wifi_list_cont == NULL) return;
    lv_obj_clean(wifi_list_cont); // 全清后for重建行
```
* 粘滞根因`dm_net.c`（置1后仅下次`scan_start`清零，重建后不清）：
  * `/data/dm/vendor/allwinnertech/apps/luncher_dm/dm_net.c:297-298`：`if (r->scan_complete) { g_scan_done = 1;`
  * `/data/dm/vendor/allwinnertech/apps/luncher_dm/dm_net.c:347-348`：`g_scan_done = 0; // 仅scan_start清`
  * `/data/dm/vendor/allwinnertech/apps/luncher_dm/dm_net.c:362`：`int dm_net_wifi_scan_done(void) { return g_scan_done; }`
* 对照`ui_bt.c:356-357`已有防重建守卫：`if (dm_net_bt_scan_done() && bt_list_cont && !bt_list_built)`，wifi侧缺失。

**2. `ui/ui_files.c` — 复制线程/递归/关页不停worker**

* 线程创建（`NULL` attr=默认栈，无4KB显式设置，全仓无`pthread_attr_setstacksize`）：
  * `/data/dm/vendor/allwinnertech/apps/luncher_dm/ui/ui_files.c:890-899`
```c
    files_copy_ui_show();
    if (pthread_create(&files_copy_thread, NULL, files_copy_worker, NULL) != 0) {
        files_copy_running = 0;
        // ...回滚timer/UI...
    }
    pthread_detach(files_copy_thread); // detach后无法join/cancel
```
  * 状态定义`/data/dm/vendor/allwinnertech/apps/luncher_dm/ui/ui_files.c:91-99`：`files_copy_thread/running/done/ok/total/done_bytes` + `:91 #define FILES_COPY_BUF (32*1024)`。
* 递归复制：
  * `/data/dm/vendor/allwinnertech/apps/luncher_dm/ui/ui_files.c:703-719`
```c
