**3. `music_ui_clear_ptrs`漏清 + `DM_FORCE_MONO`**

* 清理函数漏`overlay/empty_lbl`：
  * `/data/dm/vendor/allwinnertech/apps/luncher_dm/ui/ui_music.c:40-52`
```c
void music_ui_clear_ptrs(void)
{
    music_title_lbl = NULL; music_artist_lbl = NULL; music_slider = NULL;
    music_time_lbl = NULL; music_time_total_lbl = NULL; music_play_btn = NULL;
    music_play_icon = NULL; music_vol_lbl = NULL; music_list_cont = NULL;
    music_active_btn = NULL;
    // 缺：music_playlist_overlay / music_empty_lbl
}
```
  * 漏清对象定义`/data/dm/vendor/allwinnertech/apps/luncher_dm/deskmate_ui.c:1462-1464`：`lv_obj_t *music_playlist_overlay; /* full-screen, hidden */` / `*music_empty_lbl; /* "no tracks" hint */`（extern见`deskmate_ui.h:180,182`），赋值处`ui_music.c:189 music_playlist_overlay = ov;`和`ui_music.c:273-274 music_empty_lbl = lv_label_create(list);`，使用处`ui_music.c:165-166,330-334`判空/显隐——关页后成野指针。
  * 调用点`deskmate_ui.c:632 music_ui_clear_ptrs(); // close_subpage先置空再del`。
* `DM_FORCE_MONO`：
  * 定义`/data/dm/vendor/allwinnertech/apps/luncher_dm/deskmate_ui.c:1449-1453`：`#define DM_FORCE_MONO 0 // 0=恢复立体声`
